# The stock camera provider picks its camera table by
# ro.vendor.qti.va_aosp.support (camera/camera.mk): set, it loads the FP6 table
# with every lens. Unreadable or unset, Qualcomm's generic table with the main
# and front cameras only.
#
# The property's type is declared in this partition's private policy, so the
# rule is here and names the camera HAL server attribute. The provider
# (hal_camera_default) is its only member on this product. The Bluetooth and
# GNSS HALs ask the same library question. They get no grant and keep reading
# the default.
get_prop(hal_camera_server, vendor_exported_system_prop)
